<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Boards (230)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>boards
</pre>
<p>Lists the boards in the game: each board's name, and the room it is in 
("the bulletin board in The Temple of Odin"). A board is added to the 
list when it is loaded, so after a reboot only the boards that have been 
loaded since appear.
</p><p>It is logged. For how players use a board, see <a cmd='#'>Help Boards</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Boards</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Write</a>
</pre>




</div>